{"id":19,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">كٓ</span>هي<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">عٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">صٓ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"ذِكْرُ رَحْمَتِ رَبِّكَ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>دَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> زَكَرِيَّآ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"إِذْ نَادَىٰ رَبَّهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> نِد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءً خَفِيًّا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"قَالَ رَبِّ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى وَهَنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَظْمُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>شْتَعَلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّأْسُ شَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">بًا و</span>َلَمْ أَك<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ُنۢ ب</span>ِدُع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِكَ رَبِّ شَقِيًّا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى خِفْتُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِىَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن و</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِى وَكَانَتِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>مْرَأَتِى عَاقِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رًا ف</span>َهَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span> لِى م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ل</span>َّدُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>َ وَلِيًّا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"يَرِثُنِى وَيَرِثُ مِنْ ءَالِ يَعْقُوبَ‌ۖ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>عَلْهُ رَبِّ رَضِيًّا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"i